    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385480/extras/264c8dc0d333460e234309e04ded0b35.webp?t=1743964728\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in a seemingly abandoned ship. Your options limited. An AI going rogue and a mystery to unfold. To survive you have to use anything you can get your hands on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide, run... think.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385480/extras/dd4781435795e250c7581a50f79f2b87.webp?t=1743964728\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extremely intelligent enemy AI</strong> that <i>learns</i> from the player actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront many unique incredible intelligent enemies. Some can be stopped for some time, and some can even be killed. Most of them won't go down though so plan accordingly and <strong>avoid conflict when possible</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They learn from you and will adapt to your playstyle. They may even share knowledge with the other ones. Forcing you to adapt as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent changes stay on them, like blinding them for good and they will be like that next time you find them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385480/extras/0e44d35e86159135fe29c169e737539e.webp?t=1743964728\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a lot of useful things around. <strong>Collect, or craft your own</strong>, and use them to open new areas, treat your injuries, place traps for your enemies, or even confront them directly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember they learn from you!</strong> Adapt too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385480/extras/89f229dcc5230fa96dfdeb757408745f.webp?t=1743964728\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With so many secrets in the ship. You have no other option but to uncover its insides deeply. Solve its riddles in the form of machines, cryptic symbolism, hidden locations and any other obstacle that you encounter unexpectedly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385480/extras/cd008b240652ae63dd6c5466d1a060c7.webp?t=1743964728\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who is the <strong>mysterious masked person</strong>? What happened before you got involved in this horrying place? Are there <i>answers</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suddenly you are in strange places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the randomization of everything from item spawning, puzzle solutions; A big map with several branches; So many enemies with unpredictable behaviour that learns from you; <strong>no play-through is the same even for the same player.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385480/extras/0882a2e859e49d6cc0387c1b96dfc362.webp?t=1743964728\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This game features explicit, violent, disturbing, and extremely terrifying content.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385480/extras/a80e2f3abb70c80498c3b7433604865d.webp?t=1743964728\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the... I wand..r. In teh... I hidd.. In tih... I eat b...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The answers are outside.</strong></p>",
